Years ago, while desperately seeking a cure for my sister&#x27;s illness, I had <ruby>nibbled<rt>nibbled</rt></ruby> at German, the language of a country advanced in medicine. I turned my unreliable memory upside down and scraped the bottom. Somehow I put together a translation that made sense.

The sentence probably said this:

&#x27;My Great Law-Head, what happened on the Night of Crystal?&#x27;
